\tag{fnip}
\title{Linearization at an equilibrium}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{An [equilibrium](fnip-0014) is a state at which the velocity
vanishes. A state near that point still moves.}

\p{Which linear equation governs a small displacement from the
equilibrium, and which pictures do the eigenvalues of that equation
draw in the plane?}

